  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Plant Protection Scheme” was launched by the Department of Agriculture &amp;amp; Farmers’ Welfare, Government of Meghalaya to control pests and diseases including weeds and rodents of horticultural crops by the distribution of bio-pesticides/Bio-agents and equipment at 50% subsidy.\n",
  "eligibility": "\n   1. The applicant/farmer should be a resident of Meghalaya.\n   1. The applicant should be a bonafide farmer engaged in Agriculture, possessing own or leased land of at least 0.2 (hectares) or more.\n\n**Note:** The applicant farmer can avail of the benefits of the scheme on a first come first serve basis.\n",
